 text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 border border-gray-300 hover:border-gray-400 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors\"\n            >\n              Sign out\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        ) : (\n          <div className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium\">Task Assignment System</div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </header>\n  );\n};\n"
    }
